{
 "v": 2,
 "src_hash": "b000bb9b38c7cb7d",
 "duration": 1158,
 "size": 9261183,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.6,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "欢迎来到求职专题第一期。今天不讲新闻，讲招聘广告。"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.58,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "在德国找工作，英语和德语的招聘广告里，有一批词会反复出现。今天学十一个，都是读广告、写简历、面试时能直接用上的。"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.51,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "每个词，先听招聘广告里怎么说，再听你可以怎么用它介绍自己。招聘广告，英语叫："
  },
  {
   "start": 30.88,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "job posting."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.35,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语叫："
  },
  {
   "start": 35.52,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Stellenanzeige."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.51,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "我们开始。"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.58,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第一个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.86,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "take ownership."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.4,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "take ownership."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.87,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是把一件事当成自己的事，从头负责到底，出了问题也不推给别人。后面常跟介词：负责某件事。"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.56,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语有两种说法。一个是动词短语："
  },
  {
   "start": 66.18,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Verantwortung übernehmen."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.44,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里更常见的是一个形容词："
  },
  {
   "start": 75.04,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "eigenverantwortlich."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.17,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 82.64,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "You take ownership of your projects from concept to production."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.22,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 89.42,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie arbeiten eigenverantwortlich und übernehmen Verantwortung für Ihre Projekte."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.65,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "介绍自己时可以说："
  },
  {
   "start": 99.4,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "I took ownership of the tool, from the first prototype to daily use by my colleagues."
  },
  {
   "start": 106.17,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆小技巧：这个短语里的名词，来自拥有这个动词。把一件事当成是自己拥有的，就会主动负责。德语的形容词，前半部分正好也是自己的，后半部分是负责的。两种语言，都是在说：这是我自己的事。"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.2,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.47,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "take ownership."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.42,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "eigenverantwortlich."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.85,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第二个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.12,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "proven track record."
  },
  {
   "start": 147.17,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "proven track record."
  },
  {
   "start": 149.69,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是过去的成绩，可以拿出来证明。招聘广告用它来要求工作经验和成果。"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.56,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 160.74,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "nachweisbare Erfolge."
  },
  {
   "start": 164.98,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "前半部分来自动词："
  },
  {
   "start": 167.8,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "nachweisen."
  },
  {
   "start": 171.09,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 174.56,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "You have a proven track record of delivering AI projects."
  },
  {
   "start": 179.05,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 181.24,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie verfügen über nachweisbare Erfolge in der Umsetzung von KI-Projekten."
  },
  {
   "start": 188.38,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "刚毕业经验不多时，可以诚实又积极地说："
  },
  {
   "start": 193.14,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "I don't have a long track record yet, but I can show concrete results from my thesis."
  },
  {
   "start": 199.48,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：田径场上的跑道，旁边的记分牌记着你每一次的成绩。中间这个词就是跑道，后面这个词就是记录。跑道上的成绩记录，再加上被证明过的，就是这个词组。"
  },
  {
   "start": 217.41,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 219.68,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "a proven track record."
  },
  {
   "start": 225.34,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "nachweisbare Erfolge."
  },
  {
   "start": 232.09,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第三个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 234.36,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "hands-on."
  },
  {
   "start": 236.83,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "hands-on."
  },
  {
   "start": 239.3,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是喜欢亲自动手做，不只是在旁边出主意。形容人，也形容经验。"
  },
  {
   "start": 247.72,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语广告常用："
  },
  {
   "start": 250.18,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "praxisnah."
  },
  {
   "start": 253.18,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "形容人的时候，还常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 256.48,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "eine anpackende Art."
  },
  {
   "start": 260.95,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 264.42,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "We are looking for a hands-on engineer who enjoys building things."
  },
  {
   "start": 269.36,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 271.56,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie haben eine anpackende Art und arbeiten gern praxisnah."
  },
  {
   "start": 277.66,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "介绍自己："
  },
  {
   "start": 279.83,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "I'm hands-on: I build and test my prototypes myself."
  },
  {
   "start": 285.02,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：两只手直接放在机器上。手放在上面，就是这个词。德语那个形容词来自一个动词，意思是伸手抓住、开始干活。"
  },
  {
   "start": 299.66,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 301.93,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "hands-on experience."
  },
  {
   "start": 307.59,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "praxisnah."
  },
  {
   "start": 313.09,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第四个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 315.36,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "at the intersection of."
  },
  {
   "start": 318.41,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "at the intersection of."
  },
  {
   "start": 320.93,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是处在两个领域交汇的地方。很多新岗位都是这样：一半懂工程，一半懂数据或者软件。"
  },
  {
   "start": 331.29,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 333.46,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "an der Schnittstelle zwischen."
  },
  {
   "start": 337.66,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "中间这个名词，在技术德语里还有一个意思：接口。比如软件接口，也叫："
  },
  {
   "start": 346.43,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Schnittstelle."
  },
  {
   "start": 349.89,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 353.36,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The role sits at the intersection of engineering and IT."
  },
  {
   "start": 358.21,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 360.4,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Stelle liegt an der Schnittstelle zwischen Entwicklung und IT."
  },
  {
   "start": 366.17,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "这句话特别适合介绍你的论文："
  },
  {
   "start": 369.85,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "My thesis sits at the intersection of product development and AI."
  },
  {
   "start": 375.14,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：两条马路交叉的十字路口。英语的核心名词就是十字路口。德语那个词，前半部分是切开，后半部分是位置：两条线切过的那个点。"
  },
  {
   "start": 391.02,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 393.3,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "at the intersection of."
  },
  {
   "start": 398.74,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "an der Schnittstelle."
  },
  {
   "start": 404.74,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第五个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 407.02,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "stakeholder."
  },
  {
   "start": 409.49,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "stakeholder."
  },
  {
   "start": 411.96,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是和一个项目有利害关系的所有人：用户、领导、其他部门、客户。"
  },
  {
   "start": 420.19,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语公司里常常直接说英语这个词。纯德语的说法是："
  },
  {
   "start": 426.8,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Beteiligten."
  },
  {
   "start": 430.16,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "复数最常用。动词是参与："
  },
  {
   "start": 434.32,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "beteiligt sein."
  },
  {
   "start": 438.04,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 441.51,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "You work closely with stakeholders across the company."
  },
  {
   "start": 445.93,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 448.12,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie stimmen sich eng mit allen Beteiligten ab."
  },
  {
   "start": 453.02,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "介绍自己："
  },
  {
   "start": 455.2,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "I aligned the classification rules with stakeholders from engineering."
  },
  {
   "start": 460.96,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆小技巧：后半部分是拿着、握着的人，前半部分是赌注。原来指替赌局双方保管赌注的人。今天的意思是：对结果押了东西、在乎结果的人。"
  },
  {
   "start": 476.63,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 478.9,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "key stakeholders."
  },
  {
   "start": 484.09,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "alle Beteiligten."
  },
  {
   "start": 490.18,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第六个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 492.46,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "sound knowledge of."
  },
  {
   "start": 495.43,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "sound knowledge of."
  },
  {
   "start": 497.9,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "注意，这里的第一个词不是声音的意思，而是健全的、扎实的。比如身心健全，英语就用这个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 508.6,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语广告几乎每篇都有："
  },
  {
   "start": 511.98,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "fundierte Kenntnisse in."
  },
  {
   "start": 516.17,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "注意，德语后面跟的介词是在里面："
  },
  {
   "start": 520.7,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Kenntnisse in Python."
  },
  {
   "start": 525.16,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 528.63,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Sound knowledge of Python is required."
  },
  {
   "start": 532.23,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 534.43,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie verfügen über fundierte Kenntnisse in Python."
  },
  {
   "start": 539.76,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "写简历时："
  },
  {
   "start": 541.96,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "I have sound knowledge of Python and data analysis."
  },
  {
   "start": 546.38,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：一栋房子的地基打得很深很稳。德语这个形容词就来自地基。地基扎实，知识就扎实。"
  },
  {
   "start": 557.97,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 560.24,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "sound knowledge of Python."
  },
  {
   "start": 566.17,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "fundierte Kenntnisse in Python."
  },
  {
   "start": 573.56,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第七个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 575.83,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "proficient in."
  },
  {
   "start": 578.35,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "proficient in."
  },
  {
   "start": 580.82,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是熟练掌握某个工具或技能。比一般的会，程度更高。"
  },
  {
   "start": 587.95,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语广告最常用的是这个固定搭配："
  },
  {
   "start": 591.92,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "sicherer Umgang mit."
  },
  {
   "start": 595.85,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "前半部分是稳当的，后半部分是打交道。和工具稳稳当当地打交道，就是熟练。完整句子常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 606.69,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie haben einen sicheren Umgang mit Excel."
  },
  {
   "start": 611.52,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 614.98,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "You are proficient in Python and SQL."
  },
  {
   "start": 618.99,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 621.19,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie haben einen sicheren Umgang mit Python und SQL."
  },
  {
   "start": 627.19,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "用德语介绍自己可以说："
  },
  {
   "start": 630.52,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Ich habe einen sicheren Umgang mit Python und pandas."
  },
  {
   "start": 636.42,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆小技巧：英语这个词后面跟的介词是在里面，德语跟的介词是和。一个是在技能里面很熟，一个是和工具打交道很稳。"
  },
  {
   "start": 650.32,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 652.59,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "proficient in Python."
  },
  {
   "start": 658.38,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "sicherer Umgang mit Python."
  },
  {
   "start": 665.58,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第八个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 667.85,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "business fluent."
  },
  {
   "start": 670.61,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "business fluent."
  },
  {
   "start": 673.08,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是语言好到可以在工作中开会、谈判，不只是日常聊天。招聘广告用它要求语言水平。"
  },
  {
   "start": 683.85,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是一个很有代表性的词："
  },
  {
   "start": 687.32,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "verhandlungssicher."
  },
  {
   "start": 690.89,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "前半部分是谈判，后半部分是稳当的。能稳稳地谈判，就是这个水平。比它低一级，常写成："
  },
  {
   "start": 701.56,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "fließend."
  },
  {
   "start": 704.64,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "招聘广告里，英语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 708.1,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Business fluent English and very good German are required."
  },
  {
   "start": 713.22,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 715.41,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Sie sprechen verhandlungssicheres Englisch und sehr gutes Deutsch."
  },
  {
   "start": 721.49,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "简历的语言部分可以这样写："
  },
  {
   "start": 725.08,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "English: business fluent. German: good working knowledge."
  },
  {
   "start": 731.03,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：会议室里，你用外语和对方讨价还价，稳稳当当，一点不慌。这就是可以谈判的语言水平。"
  },
  {
   "start": 742.22,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 744.49,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "business fluent."
  },
  {
   "start": 749.65,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "verhandlungssicher."
  },
  {
   "start": 755.72,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第九个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 757.99,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "production-ready."
  },
  {
   "start": 760.54,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "production-ready."
  },
  {
   "start": 763.01,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是一个系统已经足够稳定，可以真正拿去用，而不只是实验室里的原型。人工智能岗位的广告特别爱用这个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 775.12,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
